{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19529","headline":"洛滨病卧户部李侍郎见惠药物谑以文星之句斐然仰谢 · 刘禹锡","name":"洛滨病卧户部李侍郎见惠药物谑以文星之句斐然仰谢","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"隐几支颐对落晖，故人书信到柴扉。\n周南留滞商山老，星象如今属少微。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19529.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19529","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}